  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="23">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 23</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And gif man gehadodne mid fahðe belecge ⁊ secge þæt he wære dǽdbana oððe rædbana, ladige mid his magan þe fahðe moton mid beran oððe forebetan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if a man in holy orders is charged with vendetta, and accused of having committed or instigated homicide, he shall clear himself with the help of his kin, who must share the vendetta with him or pay compensation for it.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
